OL,3,ACompanies exploiting welfare system by
OL,4,Ausing residents as 'cash cows', BBC
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe system - called supported exempt
OL,8,Faccommodation (SEA) - is designed for
OL,9,Fpeople in the UK with additional needs,
OL,10,Fincluding former prisoners, people
OL,11,Frecovering from addiction and women
OL,12,Ffleeing domestic abuse. It provides
OL,13,Fhousing along with care, support and
OL,14,Fsupervision.
OL,16,FFor many residents it works well to
OL,17,Fhelp them get back on their feet, but
OL,18,Fcharities, politicians and residents
OL,19,Ftell us parts of the system are being
OL,20,Fexploited.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
