OL,3,ACall for partial curfews across France
OL,4,Aafter protests as Vinted says it's
OL,5,Aremoving looted items
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of France's Chambers of
OL,8,FCommerce and Industry says 2,000
OL,9,Fbusinesses have been directly impacted
OL,10,Fby the demonstrations - re-selling
OL,11,Fplatform Vinted says it is taking
OL,12,Fimmediate action to "remove listings
OL,13,Flinked to looting"
OL,15,FThe disorder began last month with
OL,16,Fstudents protesting over school
OL,17,Fconditions, but have since escalated to
OL,18,Ftake in a broader range of concerns
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
