OL,3,ACall for partial curfews across France
OL,4,Aafter protests as Vinted says it's
OL,5,Aremoving looted items
OL,6,
OL,7,FLecornu says the movement is being led
OL,8,Fby "ultra-left radical groups" hoping
OL,9,Fto "create chaos" before the 2027
OL,10,FFrench presidential elections
OL,12,FMore than half a million people took to
OL,13,Fthe streets on Saturday. On Sunday,
OL,14,Fmore than 350 arrests were made in
OL,15,FParis alone, with at least five shops
OL,16,Flooted
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
